### GET all games
GET http://localhost/api/games
Accept: application/json

### POST games by filter - Board games only
POST http://localhost/api/games/filter
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categories": ["BOARDGAME", "NATIVE"]
}

### POST games by filter - Price range (under 2.00)
POST http://localhost/api/games/filter
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "minPrice": {
    "currency": "EUR",
    "amount": 0
  },
  "maxPrice": {
    "currency": "EUR",
    "amount": 2.00
  }
}

### POST games by filter - Combined filters (boardgame under 5.00)
POST http://localhost/api/games/filter
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categories": ["BOARDGAME"],
  "maxPrice": {
    "currency": "EUR",
    "amount": 5.00
  }
}

### POST games by filter - No results expected
POST http://localhost/api/games/filter
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categories": ["STRATEGY"]
}

### GET user with owned games
GET http://localhost/api/users/c9d8cc34-6087-4a6f-a6c2-e208fbbc6ed2/games
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json